; claude: cryptography, from scratch, for teaching (plan_teaching_other.md
; section 4b): one idea per module, each .mli with its diagram, worked
; example (the standards' own test vectors) and references, like
; graphics/, audio/ and networking/. SHA-1, for the WebSocket handshake
; (Websocket.mli); and what TLS 1.3 needs (plan_tls.md, networking/tls/):
; SHA-256 and SHA-384, HMAC, HKDF, ChaCha20-Poly1305, AES-GCM, big
; numbers, X25519, ECDSA, RSA. A private library, installed as part of
; elm_playground, pure OCaml: the hashes in Int32 and Int64, the same
; bits natively and in a browser; the big numbers, the curves and
; Poly1305 in native 63-bit ints, native only, as TLS is.
(library
 (name crypto)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
